    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Maybe that’s why May feels different.⁠\n⁠\nThe windows stay open.⁠\nThe evenings stretch.⁠\nThe streets fill with voices again.⁠\n⁠\nYou start walking slower.⁠\nStaying out longer.⁠\nRemembering that the world can feel wide and full of possibility.⁠\n⁠\nSometimes healing arrives like that—⁠\nnot all at once,⁠\nbut as light returning.",
